==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 9~12 seconds<sup>270f~360f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 12~23.33 seconds<sup>360f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Nebaaru-kun (Enemy)|Nebaaru-kun]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 12~22 seconds<sup>360f~660f</sup>.
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A pretty easy and simple stage, any types of hard hitting units and any ranged units are able to help with beating this stage.

